Modifications

    feedback.f90:
	Swapped the following lines (commented vs uncommented, and fixed some typos in the authors' names), i.e. changed this:

        !mlossmetals(j,1)=mlossmetals(j,1)+numII*0.375d0*exp(-17.94d0/meanmassM)*scale_m/vol_loc(j)  !1=Fe  ------ Woosley & Hager (2007)
        !mlossmetals(j,2)=mlossmetals(j,2)+numII*27.66d0*exp(-51.81d0/meanmassM)*scale_m/vol_loc(j)  !2=O ------ Woosley & Hager (2007)
        mlossmetals(j,1)=mlossmetals(j,1)+numII*SNII_Fe_yield(meanmassM,mettM)*scale_m/vol_loc(j) !1=Fe EDGE2
        mlossmetals(j,2)=mlossmetals(j,2)+numII*SNII_O_yield(meanmassM,mettM)*scale_m/vol_loc(j)  !2=O  EDGE2

	by this:

        mlossmetals(j,1)=mlossmetals(j,1)+numII*0.375d0*exp(-17.94d0/meanmassM)*scale_m/vol_loc(j)  !1=Fe  ------ Woosley & Hager (2007)
        mlossmetals(j,2)=mlossmetals(j,2)+numII*27.66d0*exp(-51.81d0/meanmassM)*scale_m/vol_loc(j)  !2=O ------ Woosley & Hager (2007)
        !mlossmetals(j,1)=mlossmetals(j,1)+numII*SNII_Fe_yield(meanmassM,mettM)*scale_m/vol_loc(j) !1=Fe EDGE2
        !mlossmetals(j,2)=mlossmetals(j,2)+numII*SNII_O_yield(meanmassM,mettM)*scale_m/vol_loc(j)  !2=O  EDGE2
